  "rev_gc_pay_p2": "Neosurf is a notable inclusion that is especially popular among Australian and European players who prefer prepaid voucher-based deposits. This allows players to fund their accounts without sharing banking details, adding a layer of privacy. Neosurf is deposit-only, however, so you will need an alternative method for withdrawals.",
