  "rev_gc_support_p1": "Live chat support is available during extended hours but is not 24/7. During our testing, we found support to be accessible from approximately 8:00 AM to midnight CET on weekdays, with reduced hours on weekends. Response times within active hours were good, typically under five minutes, and the agents were helpful and knowledgeable. Email support is available around the clock with response times of 6 to 12 hours. There is no phone support.",
