  "rev_lv_cashback_p2": "This cashback program is particularly valuable for regular players because it provides a meaningful safety net. If you have a losing week, getting back up to 20% of your losses helps extend your bankroll and gives you another opportunity to play. The reduced wagering on cashback funds means you can actually withdraw these funds without having to play through them dozens of times.",
  "rev_lv_games_p1": "LuckyVibe's library exceeds 5,000 titles, with slots making up the vast majority. The slots selection is excellent, featuring popular titles from Pragmatic Play, BGaming, Hacksaw Gaming, Relax Gaming, and many others. You will find everything from classic slots to modern feature-buy games, megaways titles, and cluster-pay mechanics. The library is well-curated, with new releases added regularly, often within days of their global launch.",
